<p>Chinese President Xi Jinping met Russian Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov in Beijing on April 15 as China hosted a string of foreign leaders from countries affected by the Middle East war, according to Chinese state media and multiple reports. In the meeting, Xi called China-Russia ties &quot;precious&quot; and urged deeper all-round cooperation. Chinese and Russian readouts cast the relationship as a source of stability amid what Xi described as a chaotic international environment. The broader diplomatic push reflects how the Middle East war has sharpened concerns about energy security and wider geopolitical alignment. Lavrov said Russia could help offset Chinese energy shortages while shipping through the Strait of Hormuz remains constrained by the Iran war. Separately, Xi told Abu Dhabi Crown Prince Sheikh Mohamed bin Zayed Al Nahyan that China would play a constructive role in promoting peace talks, underscoring Beijing&#x27;s effort to present itself as both a steady partner and a possible mediator.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/gVax81mT2w4K-uNSw1aUOJYpuDTpgCPY1Ezm4BysllJ3CK9L0JmdfZ0aT2beZgzr3_xcddtuFsqLLNuK5aHfuuYWUiJbmARsl_xhqbmj0NVD' alt='Chinese President Xi Jinping and Russia’s Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov shake hands at the Great Hall of the People in Beijing, China on April 15, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Treaty framing: Xi said the &#x27;strong vitality and exemplary significance&#x27; of the China-Russia friendship treaty stand out even more in the current international climate.</li><li>UN emphasis: Xi called on China and Russia to bolster the authority of the United Nations while describing their partnership as a stabilizing force in a turbulent global landscape.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>China: In talks with Spain&#x27;s Pedro Sanchez, Xi said the world was facing &#x27;chaos and turmoil&#x27; and &#x27;a contest between justice and force,&#x27; presenting the Middle East crisis as part of a broader struggle over international order. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991931/xi-meets-russian-fm-as-leaders-flock-to-china-over-middle-east-war'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Spain: Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez welcomed China&#x27;s efforts to help resolve the Middle East conflict during his meeting with Xi. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991931/xi-meets-russian-fm-as-leaders-flock-to-china-over-middle-east-war'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991931/xi-meets-russian-fm-as-leaders-flock-to-china-over-middle-east-war'>Xi meets Russian FM as leaders flock to China over Middle East war</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/xi-calls-china-russia-ties-precious-current-international-132050372'>Xi calls China-Russia ties &#x27;precious&#x27; in current international context</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/xi-hails-china-russia-ties-signals-bigger-role-in-iran-war/a-76787130'>Xi hails China-Russia ties, signals bigger role in Iran war</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3350167/strong-china-russia-relations-are-stabilising-force-turbulent-landscape-xi-jinping'>Strong China-Russia relations are stabilising force in a ‘turbulent’ landscape: Xi Jinping</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/xi-jinping-calls-china-russia-ties-precious-in-current-international-context/article70864441.ece'>Xi Jinping calls China-Russia ties &#x27;precious&#x27; in current international context</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/xi-meets-russian-fm-as-leaders-flock-to-china-over-middle-east-war'>Xi meets Russian foreign minister  as leaders flock to China over Middle East war</a> - japantoday.com</li></ul>